    659  f062							; Phase 3: .Row no longer re-stores Temp→COLUBK per band (the slot now
    660  f062							; holds the BandTab ENABL gate), so this store IS the cave's COLUBK.
    661  f062							; Temp is free here onward for the staged BallX (bank2 StageBandTab) —
    662  f062							; no reader between this point and overscan's own `sta Temp` (joystick).
