   1153  f18f							; --- Call bank1 for 13+2 HUD rendering via fold-pad at $FC68 ---
   1154  f18f							; The fold-pad at $FC68 has identical bytes in bank0 and bank1:
   1155  f18f							;   $FC68: lda #1 / sta $1FF5 / jmp $F540
   1156  f18f							; After sta $1FF5, CPU reads next instruction from bank1 at $FC6D.
