   2915  f945							; CollisionEndY = bottom row, CollisionEndX = min col, CollisionCellX = max
   2916  f945							; col — cols are endpoint-mirrored above, so ALWAYS 0-19 here (no in-loop
   2917  f945							; mirror; bank2 display-space walkers add their own when they convert).
