   2919  f945							; before — same ZP, no new allocation).
   2920  f945							; Exits: HIT -> jmp HotOverlapFlag (tail, C=1 contract preserved);
   2921  f945							;	  miss -> clc / rts. Stack depth during the walk = old walk exactly
