   3006  f97a							; last one is taken). LevelStartRoom b6-4 = miners still to rescue: b4 = the
   3007  f97a							; level's own miner, b5/b6 = extra miners (record type 15) by room parity (RoomNo
   3008  f97a							; & 1). LoadLevelB2 seeds it; a rescue clears its bit; the usual tally arms when
   3009  f97a							; none is left. tools/test_miners.py drives all of this on the frozen banks.
