   3485  fba2							; CEH_KeyDisp / power cell (record type 14 = KEY|8, user request 2026-10-26):
   3486  fba2							; every `and #7` in the type consumers folds 14 to 6, so CheckEnemyHit lands on
   3487  fba2							; the key arm; this entry re-reads the record (FetchPtr is still staged) and
   3488  fba2							; sends a type-14 record to the cell: the slot vanishes (no life, no score), the
   3489  fba2							; timer bar is refilled to BAR_MAX, and bit (RoomNo & 3) of LevelStartRoom b3-0
   3490  fba2							; latches so bank2's room load keeps it dead on re-entry (one refill per cell
   3491  fba2							; per level: leaving and coming back is not an infinite recharge). TickCounter is
   3492  fba2							; left alone on purpose - the 60-frame clock also paces PickPlayerFrame, and a
   3493  fba2							; partial second on top of a full bar is harmless. The generator keeps cell
   3494  fba2							; rooms distinct mod 4. Guard: tools/test_power_cell.py.
