   4358  fe90							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   4359  fe90							; FoldIndirect — cross-bank data fetch (HERO fold, write-triggered;
   4360  fe90							; level_bank_plan §0.1). Pad lands $FEF6-$FEFF (last byte ≤ $FEFF — $FF00
   4361  fe90							; stays the fineAdjust anchor). Bytes must be byte-identical in bank2
   4362  fe90							; (guard: verify_build) — after `sta $1FF6` the CPU fetches the remainder
   4363  fe90							; from the data bank at the same PC.
   4364  fe90							; Contract: bank select is ABSOLUTE $1FF6 (bank2) — X/Y both preserved,
   4365  fe90							; A = junk in, data out (`sta $1FF4` switches back, A preserved).
   4366  fe90							; P3.1 deviation (plan §0): `sta $1FF6,X` required X=0, but every enemy
   4367  fe90							; loop keeps the slot in X and has no free temp to swap (DEY/snake hold
   4368  fe90							; Temp live across the read). All level data is bank2, so X-selection is
   4369  fe90							; dead weight; bank3 data later needs a second entry `sta $1FF7` pad.
   4370  fe90							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   4371  fe90							; E4 moth entry tramp ($FEF0-$FEF5) — byte-identical with bank2's copy
   4372  fe90							; (guard: verify_build check_moth_tramp). bank0 executes `sta $1FF6`; the next
   4373  fe90							; fetch ($FEF3) comes from bank2 = `jmp MothRoutine`. Neither bank runs its
   4374  fe90							; other half: bank0 is switched away at $FEF2, bank2 is never entered here.
   4375  fe90							; The 6-byte pad is the only free hole before FoldIndirect's pinned $FEF6.
   4376  fe90							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   4377  fe90		       00 00 00 00*	      .ds	$FE96 - *, 0	; S5.4 LHT entry tramp (byte-identical w/ bank2,
   4378  fe96							; guard: check_moth_tramp — shifted +$10)
   4379  fe96				   LaserHitTest
   4380  fe96		       8d f6 1f 	      sta	$1FF6	; select bank2
   4381  fe99		       4c 00 ff 	      jmp	$FF00	; bank2 LaserHitTestBody (dead in bank0; guard
   4382  fe9c							;   pins operands == bank2.lst label)
