   4387  fe9c							; TallyWork — level-bonus count-up (user spec 2026-10-02): reaching the miner
   4388  fe9c							; freezes the frame (dispatch bypasses input/physics/enemies via DropTarget
   4389  fe9c							; $FE), bank2 TallyEntry adds +50 every 4 frames and writes the coin tone
   4390  fe9c							; (every 200 pts); when TallyTicks hits 0 the done path advances the level
   4391  fe9c							; exactly like the old CheckMinerPickup tail, then rejoins OverscanAudio.
   4392  fe9c							;   Event bits in A (through ReturnPad sta/rts): b0 = add 50, b2 = done.
   4393  fe9c							;   Tail mirrors TitleWork: UpdateBombSound holds the coin (BombSnd>0), jet
   4394  fe9c							;   muted, own INTIM wait -> StartFrame: timer block skipped = frozen scene.
   4395  fe9c							; Lives in the $FE8C LHT..moth fill (bank0 has no pre-pad headroom).
   4396  fe9c							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   4397  fe9c				   TallyWork
   4398  fe9c		       20 e6 ff 	      jsr	TallyTramp	; A = event (bank2 TallyEntry step)
   4399  fe9f		       a8		      tay
   4400  fea0		       29 01		      and	#1
   4401  fea2		       f0 05		      beq	.TNoScore
   4402  fea4		       a9 50		      lda	#$50	; BCD +50 per tick (pack is $50 exactly)
   4403  fea6		       20 0b fc 	      jsr	CallPad_AddScore
   4404  fea9				   .TNoScore
   4405  fea9		       98		      tya
   4406  feaa		       29 04		      and	#4
   4407  feac		       f0 1e		      beq	.TLive
