   4512  ff20							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   4513  ff20							; LaserInput — contact missile (redesign 2026-10-08, replaces the S3 sweep):
   4514  ff20							; the beam is ONE 8px bar that LEAVES the EYE and travels +/-4px/frame toward
   4515  ff20							; the facing until contact, then resets to the eye (single missile, KISS —
   4516  ff20							; user spec: no piercing, no HERO comparison needed).
   4517  ff20							;   press edge (b7 held, b6 prev): LaserX = eye  (right RoomX-1 = nose,
   4518  ff20							;						  left	RoomX-4)
   4519  ff20							;   held frame: LaserX +/-4; LaserX >= 160 (right edge OR left underflow
   4520  ff20							;     wrap) -> reset to eye (unsigned check catches both)
   4521  ff20							;   contact (bank2 LaserHitTestBody): A = 0 continue / $50 kill (+score,
   4522  ff20							;     dead bit set in body) / 1 lamp (SetRoomDark) / 2 wall tip -> all three
   4523  ff20							;     contact kinds reset LaserX = eye BEFORE positioning (missile consumed;
   4524  ff20							;     tip-in-wall never draws: contact frame restarts at the eye; PF has
   4525  ff20							;     priority over M0 anyway).
   4526  ff20							;   release: b7/b1 cleared in the prologue, HMM0 = 0; LaserX kept (next
   4527  ff20							;     press edge re-anchors).
   4528  ff20							; PIXEL MODEL (unchanged): SetObjectXPos arg A -> drawn M0 = [A-7, A].
   4529  ff20							; LaserState: b7 held, b6 prev (press edge), b5-2 dark, b1 = .Line gate,
   4530  ff20							; b0 = rearm (contact consumed last frame — re-test the eye next frame)
   4531  ff20							; (PlayerColTable bit1 shares b1 — ENAM0 = bit1 & LaserState; the old
   4532  ff20							; LaserBeamOn $02 byte now holds LaserX, there was no free ZP byte).
   4533  ff20							; S5.4: kill/lamp/wall ACTIONS run here (pad body returns only A).
   4534  ff20							; Overscan: VBLANK on, end waits on TIM64T — SetObjectXPos's WSYNC costs 1
   4535  ff20							; of 30 lines. Temp (joystick) intact. Lives after $FF20 (pre-$FF00 full).
   4536  ff20							; ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   4537  ff20				   LaserInput
