   4693  ffe6							; jmp operand is fetched from bank1's image at the same PC (FoldIndirect
   4694  ffe6							; discipline). The bank1 body tail-jmps ReturnPad ($FBF8) -> rts back to the
   4695  ffe6							; bank0 jsr. Ends $FFEB — $FFF2-$FFF9 stay fill (F6 hotspot mirrors).
