   4704  ffec							; to bank3 with the shape/extras stream it reads). Moved off $FE90 into the
   4705  ffec							; 6-byte gap after TallyTramp. bank0 executes `sta $1FF7`; the `jmp` at +3 is
   4706  ffec							; fetched from bank3's image at $FFEF (guard: check_moth_tramp).
